-- More foods sold in Bangladesh, local and imported (river and sea fish, dal, seeds, grains, gourds, fruits, dairy, spices),
-- and two more ways to have an egg (raw whole, the yolk). Nutrients per 100 g are read from the USDA SR Legacy CSV
-- (FoodData Central, April 2018); a local fish with no USDA entry uses the closest one and says so in its name.
-- New foods carry no verdicts until reviewed, like every food added before them. Idempotent. Run by migration 0032 and the seeder.

UPDATE foods f SET subcategory_id = s.id FROM food_subcategories s JOIN food_categories c ON c.id = s.category_id WHERE c.slug = 'proteins' AND s.slug = 'river-fish' AND f.slug = 'katla' AND f.subcategory_id IS NULL;
